From b2861a2592264e3d178cbf12660283f779a274c6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 00:56:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 38/46] Later evolutions: raise the species limit;
 typing-change and branch groups

New species past the 22 placeholder slots now go after Chimecho, with the
Egg and Unown forms moving up (positional Hoenn/National tables, cry
table and Pokedex orders extended). Adds Probopass, Wyrdeer, Ursaluna,
Annihilape, Gallade, Froslass, Leafeon, Glaceon, Sylveon and Kleavor.
New evolution methods: item on a male/female Pokemon, and friendship plus
a move of a given type; up to 8 evolutions per Pokemon (Eevee). Dawn
Stone, Ice Stone, Peat Block and Black Augurite join the Celadon Dept.
Store 4F. Single-gender evolutions keep their own gender ratio.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
